This product is a custom integration built on the Nutanix AHV virtualization
stack. It talks to Nutanix Prism (the v3 REST API and the VNC console), mounts
an agent ISO into guest virtual machines, and includes modifications that change
how those vendor components are used. It is not a Nutanix product, and it has
not been reviewed, endorsed or supported by Nutanix, Inc.

Clipboard sync needs two optional components outside the desktop app: a host
module that is installed as a libvirt hook on Nutanix AHV hypervisor hosts, and a
guest agent that runs inside each virtual machine. Installing the host module
modifies hosts that Nutanix manages. It is not supported by Nutanix, it can affect
your Nutanix support, and AHV upgrades can remove or break it. Install it only in
environments you own or are authorised to change, and at your own risk. The
software is provided "AS IS", without warranties or conditions of any kind, as
stated in sections 7 and 8 of the Apache License 2.0. The authors accept no
